description         Deobfuscate and unminify JavaScript code using LLMs.
long_description    humanify renames the variables and functions of minified JavaScript with the \
                    help of a language model (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenRouter, Requesty or a \
                    local Ollama server), after undoing common bundler and minifier transforms.

